<title>USA: San Juan, Calif. won by Wheat First.</title>
<headline>San Juan, Calif. won by Wheat First.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat First Butcher Singer. said it won $1.800 million of San Juan Capistrano Community Redevelopment Agency, Calif., 1997 subordinated Taxable tax allocation bonds, with a net interest cost of 7.735 percent.</p>
